        theory: ("{D} kept more dogs than {D.he} could care for and let them suffer.", "A caring breeder hit by a cold snap and a helper's move."),
        allocution: "\"I took on too many.\"",
        truths: ("{DL} ignored the county letter and added eleven puppies after it.", "{DL} spent the night before sitting up in the shed breaking ice, and a vet saw the dogs two weeks earlier."),
