        openings: ("A humane officer followed up on a neighbor's call and found thirty-six dogs in {D}'s mobile home and a tin shed, with frozen water pans, soiled crates, eight underweight dogs, and two untreated eye infections. One dog died within days.", "{D} breeds and fosters small dogs and loved every one. A cold snap froze the pans overnight, and a sibling who helped had just moved away."),
