        openings: ("{V} stood in a laundromat doorway on the phone when a runner in a gray hood ripped it away and shoved {V.him} into a door frame, cutting {V}'s lip. Six minutes later a deputy stopped {D} near a creek path with a phone case in {D.his} pocket that matched {V}'s.", "{D} found that case on the sidewalk and put it in a pocket. A gray jacket and a lost case do not prove {D} was the runner."),
