        spec: "Drove carelessly and heedlessly in willful disregard of the safety of others by passing a stopped school bus, on {DATE}.",
        ages: 18...60,
        victim: false,
        summary: "On {DATE} at 3:50 p.m., a school bus stopped on a county road with flashing red lights and its stop arm out while two children got off. A pickup sped past on the right shoulder. The camera on the stop arm read the plate, registered to {D}. {DL} says a coworker borrowed the pickup that afternoon.",
