        defenseRole: "Neighbor",
        defenseExam: [.direct("How do you know {D}?", "\"I was {D}'s neighbor for years. I lived two doors down, and we talked over the fence most weekends.\""), .direct("What did you see at the defendant's home the spring before?", "\"A broken garage window. I noticed it one morning, and {DF} told me someone had broken in during the night.\""), .direct("Do you know what was taken?", "\"No. {DF} did not say exactly, and I did not want to pry into the loss of someone's belongings.\""), .direct("Did the defendant report it?", "\"I think so. {DF} said a deputy came by to look at the window, and I did see a patrol car out front.\""), .direct("Did the defendant own a green bike?", "\"I saw a green bike in the garage once, leaning on the wall. I do not know what became of it later.\""), .direct("What kind of neighbor was the defendant?", "\"Quiet and polite. {D.He} helped with yard work and never caused any trouble that I ever saw or heard.\""), .cross("Did you see the break-in itself?", "\"No. I only saw the broken window afterward, and I did not see anyone near the garage that night.\""), .cross("Do you know whether the bike was taken then?", "\"I do not. I did not look inside the garage after the break-in, so I cannot say what was missing.\""), .cross("Do you know whether a shoelace was taken?", "\"No. I know nothing about shoelaces or bike parts that {D.he} may have kept, and nothing about what was in the garage.\""), .cross("Did {D} mention a loss to you afterward?", "\"Only that something was missing. {D.He} was upset about it for a few days and then stopped talking about it.\""), .cross("How long ago was this?", "\"Six or seven years, I think. I cannot give you an exact date, and I did not write anything down at the time.\"")],
        theory: ("{D} followed two teens on a bike and killed {V}; {D.his} DNA was left on the lace.", "A stolen bike and lace and a mistaken match."),
